# Hardware: regenerable KiCad output. The orderable gerber zip, the BOM, the
# placement file and the 1:1 fit-check print are committed; everything else
# (per-user editor state, DRC report, layer SVGs, 3D renders, and the loose
# gerber files already inside the zip) is rebuilt by 'make -C hardware/<board> all'.
hardware/*/*.kicad_prl
hardware/*/fab/gerbers/
hardware/*/fab/drc-report.json
hardware/*/fab/*.svg
hardware/*/fab/*-3d-*.png
.gstack/
